{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11359","headline":"泛江送魏十八仓曹还京因寄岑中允参范郎中季明 · 杜甫","name":"泛江送魏十八仓曹还京因寄岑中允参范郎中季明","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迟日深春水，轻舟送别筵。\n帝乡愁绪外，春色泪痕边。\n见酒须相忆，将诗莫浪传。\n若逢岑与范，爲报各衰年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_11359.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11359","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}